<p>In the latest development, federal investigators said overlapping failures in staffing, runway tracking and controller workload contributed to the March 22 collision between an Air Canada Express CRJ-900 and a rescue fire truck at New York’s LaGuardia Airport. Controllers cleared both the aircraft and the truck to cross the same runway, investigators said, while a surface tracking system also failed in the moments before impact. The crash killed both pilots and injured dozens of other people on board, turning a routine landing into disaster within seconds. The reporting also placed the accident within a broader strain on the US aviation system. Semafor reported that the Federal Aviation Administration is chronically understaffed and that the two controllers on duty during the accident were doing the work of four, while outdated equipment has added pressure across the network. Coverage from Le Monde and the BBC described the collision as highly unusual, with one aviation expert saying he had never seen a plane and a ground vehicle collide, underscoring how rare and serious the event was.</p><img src='https://kagiproxy.com/img/-VZvD1kgMAkB218quwhJGPXwbSjv2R8ia6YC2YK49MH_5Yew6Lhtiqp_7qtaNYBH-73-nP7C11shVqq7vKSXXu97pWo60olgsH9sZCkAbvD5KuVz_tS2dOLrFrYYLotKAfW-ny0hQOv6GCeO6EYW8joIse_q1BV_ro-xHpwfDb7LGn0hC7N4lHXsi_4tGLB3ugPEY25dLZmV-HnGEW0-E8zGeNIvY4-ap_1096aCnvtApQahcyoxSSTjMZUFh2j0' alt='An Air Canada Express plane collided with a fire truck at New York&#x27;s LaGuardia Airport on March 22, 2026.' /><br /><h3>Highlights:</h3><ul><li>Final minutes: Investigators released details from the final three minutes of cockpit and tower communications as they reconstruct the moments before impact.</li><li>Twenty-second sequence: The Straits Times reported that the landing went from routine to disaster in about 20 seconds.</li><li>Cabin trauma: A passenger video account captured how shaken survivors remained after escaping the aircraft.</li><li>Recruitment strain: Semafor reported that controller numbers have declined for years despite recruitment efforts, and that many staff left last fall after going unpaid during a government shutdown.</li></ul><blockquote>I&#x27;ve never seen a plane and a ground vehicle collide - Daniel Bubb</blockquote><h3>Perspectives:</h3><ul><li>Federal investigators: By releasing excerpts from the final tower and cockpit exchanges, investigators signaled that the last few minutes will be central to understanding how several safeguards failed in sequence. (<a href='https://www.bbc.com/news/articles/cz67jq0enwpo'>BBC</a>, <a href='https://www.semafor.com/article/03/24/2026/laguardia-collision-highlights-us-aviation-woes'>Semafor</a>)</li><li>Daniel Bubb: The aviation expert focused on how an arriving regional jet and an airport rescue vehicle could end up in the same runway environment during landing. (<a href='https://www.lemonde.fr/en/international/video/2026/03/24/laguardia-airport-crash-i-ve-never-seen-a-plane-and-a-ground-vehicle-collide-says-aviation-expert_6751777_4.html'>Le Monde</a>)</li><li>Joe Capio: The passenger gave a first-hand cabin account of the final moments before impact and the shock that followed. (<a href='https://www.theglobeandmail.com/world/video-still-in-shock-passenger-recounts-air-canada-express-crash/'>The Globe and Mail</a>)</li><li>US media analysts: Coverage in US outlets framed the collision as evidence of a broader policy problem involving controller retention, modernization delays and political dysfunction. (<a href='https://www.semafor.com/article/03/24/2026/laguardia-collision-highlights-us-aviation-woes'>Semafor</a>)</li></ul><h3>Sources:</h3><ul><li><a href='https://www.semafor.com/article/03/24/2026/laguardia-collision-highlights-us-aviation-woes'>LaGuardia collision highlights US aviation woes</a> - semafor.com</li><li><a href='https://www.lemonde.fr/en/international/video/2026/03/24/laguardia-airport-crash-i-ve-never-seen-a-plane-and-a-ground-vehicle-collide-says-aviation-expert_6751777_4.html'>LaGuardia Airport crash: &#x27;I&#x27;ve never seen a plane and a ground vehicle collide,&#x27; says aviation expert</a> - lemonde.fr</li><li><a href='https://www.straitstimes.com/world/united-states/us-safety-agency-says-tracking-system-failed-at-laguardia-jet-collision'>US safety agency says tracking system failed in LaGuardia collision between Air Canada jet and truck</a> - straitstimes.com</li><li><a href='https://www.theglobeandmail.com/world/video-still-in-shock-passenger-recounts-air-canada-express-crash/'>‘Still in shock&#x27;: Passenger recounts Air Canada Express crash</a> - theglobeandmail.com</li><li><a href='https://www.bbc.com/news/articles/cz67jq0enwpo'>Pilots killed in LaGuardia plane crash named</a> - bbc.com</li></ul>